<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Macquarie to raise A$300 mln in trust.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Macquarie to raise A$300 mln in trust.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Macquarie Bank said it has launched a prospectus to raise A$300 million for Infrastructure Trust of Australia (ITA).</p>
<p>ITA will be managed by a wholly owned subsidiairy of Macquarie Bank, Macquarie Infrastructure Investment Management.</p>
</text>
